{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00406",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 3.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Evening. Long day, I imagine. Sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.91,
      "end_seconds": 5.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.28,
      "end_seconds": 8.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "How can I help you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.65,
      "end_seconds": 18.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "I wanted to get a very painful, swollen big toe looked at. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.23,
      "end_seconds": 21.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.16,
      "end_seconds": 24.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "I've had it since last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.34,
      "end_seconds": 27.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Any a low fever as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.74,
      "end_seconds": 33.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.69,
      "end_seconds": 37.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.9,
      "end_seconds": 40.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.69,
      "end_seconds": 57.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Any other joints swollen, chills or rash at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.8,
      "end_seconds": 61.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.1,
      "end_seconds": 68.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.56,
      "end_seconds": 72.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Well, my father had a heart attack."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.86,
      "end_seconds": 76.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.95,
      "end_seconds": 80.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.56,
      "end_seconds": 81.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.48,
      "end_seconds": 83.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.91,
      "end_seconds": 97.2,
      "duration_seconds": 12.29,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.77,
      "end_seconds": 100.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.37,
      "end_seconds": 107.47,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.56,
      "end_seconds": 116.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.48,
      "text": "I take ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, twice a day. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.87,
      "end_seconds": 119.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "So, any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.43,
      "end_seconds": 122.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Yes, I'm allergic to aspirin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.6,
      "end_seconds": 127.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.4,
      "end_seconds": 129.1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.08,
      "end_seconds": 150.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.28,
      "end_seconds": 153.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "I have kidney disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.58,
      "end_seconds": 156.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.6,
      "end_seconds": 163.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.27,
      "end_seconds": 166.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.15,
      "end_seconds": 178.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.9,
      "end_seconds": 202.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.65,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 110 over 82, heart rate 86, SpO2 98 percent on room air. Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.14,
      "end_seconds": 205.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.16,
      "end_seconds": 226.32,
      "duration_seconds": 20.16,
      "text": "Putting together what you've described, this looks most like an acute gout flare. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a very painful, swollen big toe, since last Tuesday, and no other joints swollen or chills."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.81,
      "end_seconds": 228.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.93,
      "end_seconds": 235.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "We should do kidney function tests for gout. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.42,
      "end_seconds": 237.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.17,
      "end_seconds": 261.56,
      "duration_seconds": 23.39,
      "text": "I'm prescribing colchicine, 0.5 milligrams, twice a day, for five days. It's for gout flare. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Cut right back on red meat, organ meats, beer and sugary drinks, and drink plenty of water. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.9,
      "end_seconds": 271.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the joint gets hotter or you develop a fever. That's the point to get seen urgently. I'd like to see you again in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.28,
      "end_seconds": 276.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.89,
      "end_seconds": 283.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.97,
      "end_seconds": 293.12,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "So, you know, I take the colchicine, 0.5 milligrams, twice a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.28,
      "end_seconds": 300.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.07,
      "end_seconds": 304.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.29,
      "end_seconds": 307.17,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}